'''Drowned Chargers''' are a drowned variant added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'' DLC.

They possess the same behavior of regular Chargers, but have 10% more health. They shoot four diagonal blood shots upon death. They can be spawned by {{e|Drowned Boom Fly|text=Drowned Boom Flies}} upon death, as well as (at reduced health) by {{e|Drowned Hive}}s.

