'''Elleeches''' are enemies added in ''The Binding of Isaac: Repentance'' DLC.

Their behavior is a cross between a Level 2 Charger and {{e|Small Leech}}, moving aimlessly until Isaac lines up with them cardinally. They then will charge indefinitely at Isaac, not stopping at objects.
