== Trivia ==
* Chargers first appear in the original Flash version of ''The Binding of Isaac''.
* Chargers are based on [[zelda:Rope|Ropes]] from the ''Legend of Zelda'' franchise, since both charge at the player when they are in their sight.
* {{dlc|a+}} Dank Chargers were created by Kilburn for Booster Pack #5.
* {{dlc|a+}} The behavior of the Dank Charger resembles that of the Charger from ''The End is Nigh'', another game made by Edmund McMillen.
* {{dlc|r}} Elleeches are the only [[Ascent]] enemy without "Tainted" in its name.
** Their name instead is a portmanteau combining the words "Elite" and "Leech", still carrying its elevated status.
** They also take the appearance and behavior of a Small Leech, so in a way, they could be called Tainted Small Leeches.

